# Bolão Frontend

PWA mobile-first: Next.js 15 (App Router) + TS strict + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui + Zustand + TanStack Query + RHF/Zod + Axios + PWA.

## Pastas

- `src/app/` — rotas (`(auth)`, `(protegido)`)
- `src/components/` — `ui/`, features (`auth`, `home`, `palpites`, `jogos`, …)
- `src/services/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/types/`, `src/lib/`

## Dev

- Docker: `sh dev start-dev` / `stop` / `logs` / `npm` / `npx`.
- Portas: backend **3002**, frontend **3003**.
- Instalar pacote: `npm install` no host (volume) + `sh dev` conforme necessário.
- Testes: Vitest + Testing Library — `npm test`.

## Tema

Dark esportivo; tokens em `globals.css` (`primaria`, `fundo`, `texto`, …). Cards glassmorphism; tema Copa vs Brasileirão via prop/`cores`.
